      "widgets_values": [
        "A continuous locked-off medium close-up interview / talking-head performance. The adult presenter in <Picture 1> is the only visible speaker. Preserve the exact person's facial identity, age, hairstyle, outfit, skin texture, studio background, framing, lens perspective, light direction and white balance through the entire sequence. A single unbroken camera take; no cuts, no zooms, no change of room or wardrobe. Natural human posture, breathing, occasional blinks, subtle head motions and restrained realistic gestures. The lips and facial performance should follow the provided Driving Audio at each corresponding time; do not invent dialogue or another voice. No subtitles, captions, logos or mouth obstruction. Maintain spatial, lighting and motion continuity across every generated chunk."
      ],
